          %p
            The key question is, thus: when do these statements hold? Adams gives some answers in
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Ada69"} Ada69
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                If
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
