          %p and a detailed proof of the statement in homology is in section 3 of
          %ul
            %li#Chen
              Chen,
              %em Universal coefficient theorem for homology
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/VIGRE/VIGRE2009/REUPapers/ChenJ.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %h3#ForGeneralizedCoHomology For generalized (co)homology
          %p
            The universal coefficient theorem in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+smash+product+of+spectra"} symmetric monoidal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+categories+of+spectra"} model categories of spectra
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anthony+Elmendorf"}> Anthony Elmendorf
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"} Igor Kriz
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"} Peter May
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Modern+foundations+for+stable+homotopy+theory"} Modern foundations for stable homotopy theory
              (
              %a{:href => "http://hopf.math.purdue.edu/Elmendorf-Kriz-May/modern_foundations.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            Universal coefficient theorems for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+homology"} generalized homology
            are discussed in:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Bauer"}> Friedrich Bauer
              ,
              %em Remarks on universal coefficient theorems for generalized homology theories
              Quaestiones Mathematicae
              %strong 9
              1, 4 (1986) 29-54
          %p More on the universal coefficient theorem in generalized homology is in:
          %ul
            %li#Ada69
              %p
                %strong Ada69
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Adams"} J. F. Adams
            %li#Ada74
              %p
                %strong Ada74
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Adams"} J. F. Adams
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stable+homotopy+and+generalised+homology"} Stable homotopy and generalised homology
            %li#Ati62
              %p
                %strong Ati62
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"} M. F. Atiyah
            %li#Boa95
              %p
                %strong Boa95
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J.+M.+Boardman"} J. M. Boardman
                %em Stable Operations in Generalized Cohomology
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://math.jhu.edu/~wsw/papers2/math/28a-boardman-stable.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Boardman-StableOperations.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ioan+Mackenzie+James"} Ioan Mackenzie James
                (ed.)
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Handbook+of+Algebraic+Topology"} Handbook of Algebraic Topology
                Oxford 1995 (
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-444-81779-2.X5000-7"}> doi:10.1016/B978-0-444-81779-2.X5000-7
                )
            %li
              %p
                %strong BJW95
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J.+M.+Boardman"} J. M. Boardman
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li#Schwede12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Schwede"}> Stefan Schwede
              , prop. 6.20 of
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Symmetric+spectra"} Symmetric spectra
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.uni-bonn.de/~schwede/SymSpec-v3.pdf"} pdf
          %p Further discussion along these lines includes
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Baker"}> Andrew Baker
              , Andrey Lazarev,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  On the Adams Spectral Sequence for
                  = succeed "-modules" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi R
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0105079"} arXiv.0105079
          %h3#ReferencesForKK For KK-theory
          %p
            Discussion for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-theory"} KK-theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Rosenberg"}> Jonathan Rosenberg
              , Claude Schochet,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Künneth theorem and the universal coefficient theorem for Kasparov’s generalized K-functor
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.dmj/1077306030"} EUCLID
